    "q-38899": {
      "dom_id": "step-q38899",
      "name": "Question 20",
      "problem": "Consider the solid enclosed between the paraboloids $z=-7+3{x}^{2}+2{y}^{2}$ and $z=1+{x}^{2}+{y}^{2},$ whose volume can be written in terms of double integrals, as follows:\n\n$$\nV={\\int }_{-2}^{2}{\\int }_{a(x)}^{b(x)}\\,f(x,y)\\,dy\\,dx\n$$\n\nWhat is ${a}^{2}+{b}^{2}+f?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we need to determine the projection of the intersection of our surfaces onto the $xy$-plane. So, let's find where they intersect.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-7+3{x}^{2}+2{y}^{2} & =1+{x}^{2}+{y}^{2} \\\\ 2{x}^{2}+{y}^{2} & =8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the projection of the intersection in the $xy$-plane is an ellipse.\n\nNotice that our solid can be written as a type I region: \n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,(x,y)\\in D,\\,\\,-7+3{x}^{2}+2{y}^{2}\\le z\\le 1+{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}},\n$$\n\nwhere $D$ is the interior of the ellipse $2{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}=8.$ \n\nAs a result, the volume of $R$ is given by \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}V & ={∭}_{R}\\text{d}V \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{-7+3{x}^{2}+2{y}^{2}}^{1+{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\text{d}z]\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(1+{x}^{2}+{y}^{2})-(-7+3{x}^{2}+2{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}8-2{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, notice that the boundary of $D$ consists of \n\n- the lower part $y=-\\sqrt{8-2{x}^{2}},$ and\n\n- the upper part $y=\\sqrt{8-2{x}^{2}},$\n\nfor $-2\\le x\\le 2.$ \n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}8-2{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{-2}^{2}{\\int }_{-\\sqrt{8-2{x}^{2}}}^{\\sqrt{8-2{x}^{2}}}\\,8-2{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}\\,dy\\,dx.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}^{2}+{b}^{2}+f & ={(-\\sqrt{8-2{x}^{2}})}^{2}+{(\\sqrt{8-2{x}^{2}})}^{2}+(8-2{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}) \\\\  & =(8-2{x}^{2})+(8-2{x}^{2})+(8-2{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}) \\\\  & =24-6{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-38899-a",
